## [0.3.0](https://github.com/raulgg/airpods-control/compare/v0.2.1...v0.3.0) (2026-08-27)

This release expands listening-mode control and hardens Allow Off cache handling.

### Included

- Control listening modes on unselected AirPods ([#31](https://github.com/raulgg/airpods-control/issues/31)).

